  "releaseNotes": "- [Vulkan] HeapRenderObjectCommand no longer subscribes to the dispatch group-count avals at compile time (the pre-pass re-records dispatches every frame anyway) — content-only heap changes cause ZERO command recompiles; a command compiles once per structural generation.\n- [Sg] Heap: pick-id and slot->page mirrors flush dirty slots as gap-merged sub-ranges instead of full rewrites per updater version (a recolor no longer re-uploads highWater*4 bytes twice).",
